  "text": "Hello Sarah, John, Priya — next week's CSE455 staff meeting needs a slot. My free half-hours that week are Monday 10:00-10:30 and 14:00-14:30, Tuesday 11:00-11:30 and 15:00-15:30, Wednesday 10:00-10:30 and 13:00-13:30. Which of those work for the three of you? Tell me your preference and I'll fix it in all our calendars.",
