   }
  ],
  "text": "Hello Professor Alvarez. My calendar is free at: Mon 10:00-10:30, Mon 14:00-14:30, Tue 15:00-15:30, Wed 10:00-10:30, Wed 13:00-13:30. (Tue 11:00-11:30 does not work for me — CSE452 lecture.)\n\nMy first choice is Monday 10:00-10:30, then Wednesday 13:00-13:30. Sarah, John — which of those fit you?",
  "seq": 1,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T01:31:12Z"
 },
 {
