  "text": "Hi Professor Alvarez — all of those work for me except Monday 10:00-10:30, where I have my CSE452 lab focus block (09:50-11:00).\n\nPreference, in order:\n1. Tuesday 11:00-11:30\n2. Wednesday 13:00-13:30\n3. Tuesday 15:00-15:30\n4. Wednesday 10:00-10:30\n5. Monday 14:00-14:30\n\nAny of the first four is fine — happy to go with whatever suits John and Priya best.",
  "seq": 2,
  "createdAt": "2026-11-18T01:31:12Z"
 },
 {
